IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tprai-types`
IMPORT `tprai-transfer`
IMPORT `tprai-recovery`
IMPORT `tprai-information`
IMPORT `tprai-goal`

-- Third Parties (Rights against Insurers) Act 2010 (UK) — the encoder's
-- tests. Expected values are worked by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

GIVEN e IS A `Relevant person event`, relevant IS A DATE, incurred IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Transfer facts`
`event` e `on` relevant `, liability on` incurred MEANS
    `Transfer facts` OF e, relevant, incurred, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE

march MEANS Date 1 3 2025
june MEANS Date 1 6 2025

§§ `Goal 1 — transfer`

-- s 1(1)(a) and (b).
#ASSERT `the rights are transferred under` (`event` `an insolvency event` `on` march `, liability on` june)
#ASSERT `the rights are transferred under` (`event` `an insolvency event` `on` june `, liability on` march)
-- ss 4(4), 5(1): (b) only.
#ASSERT `the rights are transferred under` (`event` `a debt relief order` `on` june `, liability on` march)
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`event` `a debt relief order` `on` march `, liability on` june))
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`event` `a debt relief order` `on` march `, liability on` march))
#ASSERT `the rights are transferred under` (`event` `died insolvent` `on` june `, liability on` march)
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`event` `died insolvent` `on` march `, liability on` june))
-- s 6(5)-(6)
#ASSERT `the rights are transferred under` (`event` (`a sanctioned compromise or arrangement` FALSE TRUE) `on` june `, liability on` march)
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`event` (`a sanctioned compromise or arrangement` TRUE TRUE) `on` june `, liability on` march))
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`event` (`a sanctioned compromise or arrangement` FALSE FALSE) `on` june `, liability on` march))
-- s 6A
#ASSERT `the rights are transferred under` (`event` (`dissolved` FALSE FALSE) `on` june `, liability on` march)
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`event` (`dissolved` TRUE FALSE) `on` june `, liability on` march))
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`event` (`dissolved` FALSE TRUE) `on` june `, liability on` march))
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`event` `none` `on` june `, liability on` march))
-- Not insured; s 15 reinsurance; Sch 3 para 3.
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`Transfer facts` OF `an insolvency event`, june, march, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`Transfer facts` OF `an insolvency event`, june, march, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the rights are transferred under` (`Transfer facts` OF `an insolvency event`, june, march, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE))

§§ `Goal 2 — recovery and enforcement`

-- Fields: established, liability, insurer's liability, set-off, insolvency
-- shortfall, FSCS eligible, FSCS claim, FSCS paid, fund limit shortfall.
GIVEN owed IS A NUMBER, insured IS A NUMBER, setoff IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Money facts`
`liability` owed `, cover` insured `, set-off` setoff MEANS
    `Money facts` OF TRUE, owed, insured, setoff, 0, FALSE, FALSE, 0, 0

-- s 8: the lesser of £100,000 and £60,000; s 10 set-off of £5,000.
#ASSERT `the amount due from the insurer under` (`liability` 100000 `, cover` 60000 `, set-off` 0) EQUALS 60000
#ASSERT `the amount due from the insurer under` (`liability` 40000 `, cover` 60000 `, set-off` 0) EQUALS 40000
#ASSERT `the amount due from the insurer under` (`liability` 100000 `, cover` 60000 `, set-off` 5000) EQUALS 55000
-- s 14(1): £100,000 − £55,000.
#ASSERT `the amount still enforceable against the insured under` (`liability` 100000 `, cover` 60000 `, set-off` 5000) EQUALS 45000
#ASSERT `the amount still enforceable against the insured under` (`liability` 40000 `, cover` 60000 `, set-off` 0) EQUALS 0
-- s 14(6)(a): insurer insolvent, £20,000 cannot be recovered; not FSCS
-- eligible: the third party may enforce £60,000 against the insured.
#ASSERT `the amount still enforceable against the insured under` (`Money facts` OF TRUE, 100000, 60000, 0, 20000, FALSE, FALSE, 0, 0) EQUALS 60000
-- s 14(7): eligible but no claim made: the shortfall counts as recoverable.
#ASSERT `the amount still enforceable against the insured under` (`Money facts` OF TRUE, 100000, 60000, 0, 20000, TRUE, FALSE, 0, 0) EQUALS 40000
-- Claimed, FSCS pays £18,000: only £2,000 is unrecoverable.
#ASSERT `the amount still enforceable against the insured under` (`Money facts` OF TRUE, 100000, 60000, 0, 20000, TRUE, TRUE, 18000, 0) EQUALS 42000
-- s 14(6)(b): fund limit shortfall £10,000.
#ASSERT `the amount still enforceable against the insured under` (`Money facts` OF TRUE, 100000, 60000, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, 0, 10000) EQUALS 50000
-- s 1(3)-(4)
#ASSERT `the third party may enforce the transferred rights under` (`liability` 100000 `, cover` 60000 `, set-off` 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`the third party may enforce the transferred rights under` (`Money facts` OF FALSE, 100000, 60000, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, 0, 0))

-- s 9
#ASSERT NOT (`the condition binds the transferred rights under` (`Condition facts` OF `to provide information or assistance`, `a deceased individual`, FALSE, FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the condition binds the transferred rights under` (`Condition facts` OF `to provide information or assistance`, `a body corporate, dissolved`, FALSE, FALSE))
#ASSERT `the condition binds the transferred rights under` (`Condition facts` OF `to provide information or assistance`, `a living individual`, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `the condition binds the transferred rights under` (`Condition facts` OF `to notify the insurer of a claim`, `a deceased individual`, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the condition binds the transferred rights under` (`Condition facts` OF `prior discharge of the liability by the insured`, `another insured`, FALSE, FALSE))
#ASSERT `the condition binds the transferred rights under` (`Condition facts` OF `prior discharge of the liability by the insured`, `another insured`, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the condition binds the transferred rights under` (`Condition facts` OF `prior discharge of the liability by the insured`, `another insured`, TRUE, TRUE))

§§ `Goal 3 — information and disclosure`

-- 28 days beginning with 10 March 2025 end on 6 April 2025; beginning with
-- 15 February 2028 (leap year), 13 March 2028.
#ASSERT `the last day to provide information under` (`Notice facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 10 3 2025) EQUALS JUST (Date 6 4 2025)
#ASSERT `the last day to provide information under` (`Notice facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 15 2 2028) EQUALS JUST (Date 13 3 2028)
#ASSERT `the last day to provide information under` (`Notice facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 10 3 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the last day to provide information under` (`Notice facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, Date 10 3 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the last day to serve a list of documents under` (`Disclosure notice facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 20 12 2025) EQUALS JUST (Date 16 1 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to serve a list of documents under` (`Disclosure notice facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 20 12 2025) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `The top-level goal`

pos MEANS `the third party position for` (`Third party case` OF (`event` `an insolvency event` `on` june `, liability on` march), (`liability` 100000 `, cover` 60000 `, set-off` 5000), JUST (`Notice facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 10 3 2025), NOTHING)
#ASSERT pos's `rights transferred`
#ASSERT pos's `may enforce against the insurer now`
#ASSERT pos's `amount due from the insurer` EQUALS 55000
#ASSERT pos's `amount still enforceable against the insured` EQUALS 45000
#ASSERT pos's `last day to provide information` EQUALS JUST (Date 6 4 2025)
#ASSERT pos's `last day to serve a list of documents` EQUALS NOTHING
noEvent MEANS `the third party position for` (`Third party case` OF (`event` `none` `on` june `, liability on` march), (`liability` 100000 `, cover` 60000 `, set-off` 5000), NOTHING, NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT (noEvent's `rights transferred`)
#ASSERT noEvent's `amount due from the insurer` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT noEvent's `amount still enforceable against the insured` EQUALS 100000
